.lcsc.com/product-detail/C3208774.html","priceUsd":12.17},{"store":"DigiKey","url":"https://www.digikey.com/en/products/result?keywords=R7FA6M5BH3CFP"},{"store":"Mouser","url":"https://www.mouser.com/c/?q=R7FA6M5BH3CFP"},{"store":"JLCPCB parts","url":"https://jlcpcb.com/parts/componentSearch?searchTxt=C3208774"},{"store":"Octopart","url":"https://octopart.com/search?q=R7FA6M5BH3CFP"}]}],"released":2021,"status":"active","datasheetUrl":"https://www.renesas.com/en/document/dst/ra6m5-group-datasheet","productUrl":"https://www.renesas.com/en/products/ra6m5","notes":["CAN: 2 channels. Part numbers starting R7FA6M5B... (feature set B, listed here) support CAN-FD on both channels. R7FA6M5A... parts are classic CAN only, so order the B parts if you need CAN-FD. External transceivers are required.","USBHS (480 Mbit/s, on-chip HS PHY, host/device) is only bonded out on the 176-pin LQFP/BGA and 100-pin BGA. The 144-pin and 100-pin LQFP parts have USBFS only.","Ethernet: one 10/100 MAC with an external PHY. The 176-pin and 100-pin LQFP are RMII-only, the 144-pin supports MII and RMII, and the 100-pin BGA has no Ethernet.","One SDHI/MMC host (4-bit SD, up to 8-bit eMMC).","10 SCI channels (9 on the 100-pin BGA), each a UART, simple SPI or simple I2C, so they are shared. There are also 3 dedicated IIC and 2 SPI.","QSPI (64 MB memory-mapped window) and OSPI (128 MB CS0 + 256 MB CS1 windows, OctaFlash/OctaRAM) are both present.","Supply is 2.7-3.6 V only. ROM boot mode supports SCI (UART) and USB (Renesas Flash Programmer).","Used on the Arduino Portenta C33 (Arduino core, PlatformIO, MicroPython).","ADC: 2 x 12-bit units with up to 26 distinct inputs on 176-pin (22 on 144-pin, 17 on 100-pin). CTSU touch: 15 / 20 / 12 channels on 176 / 144 / 100-pin LQFP.","Deep Software Standby draws about 4.8 uA typ. Ordinary Software Standby is about 2.1 mA typ on this process. Active current is about 22 mA running CoreMark at 200 MHz.","A 1 MB (R7FA6M5BF...) version and BGA versions are also available."],"sources":["https://www.renesas.com/en/document/dst/ra6m5-group-datasheet","https://www.renesas.com/en/products/ra6m5","https://www.renesas.com/en/document/mah/ra6m5-group-users-manual-hardware","https://www.renesas.com/en/products/ra6m5/part-details/r7fa6m5bh3cfc-aa0","https://www.renesas.com/en/products/ra6m5/part-details/r7fa6m5bh3cfb-aa0","https://www.renesas.com/en/products/ra6m5/part-details/r7fa6m5bh3cfp-aa0","https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/C3230172.html","https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/C3215705.html","https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/C3208774.html","https://github.com/micropython/micropython/tree/master/ports/renesas-ra/boards","https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/tree/main/boards/renesas/ek_ra6m5","https://docs.arduino.cc/hardware/portenta-c33/"],"boards":["ek-ra6m5"]}